            <div xml:id="d30-a8">

                <pb facs="0633" n="623" xml:id="pg623"/>

                <head>Annex II</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 302 (3d
                    paragraph).</p>
                <p>In the same way the arrangement for the exploitation of the section situated in
                    Hungarian territory and the line cutting Nagyszalonta to Arad and to Kisjenö by
                    Békéscsaba will guarantee direct passage in every way across Hungarian territory
                    to Roumanian trains having Roumanian traction and crews. Nevertheless, unless it
                    should be otherwise determined this passage right will cease on the completion
                    of a direct junction situated entirely in Roumanian territory between the lines
                    Nagyszalonta–Békéscsaba and Kisjenö-Békéscsaba at the expiration of ten years
                    after the coming into force of the present treaty.</p>
            </div>
